{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a335c64a27410adf7bff6a75d389f4533a66ad1e3c4d42d882591bcb71319d73", "ja": "でも、たとえ怖かったとしても、みんなの\nステージだし！　絶対、この目で見ておかなくちゃ！", "zh": "不过，就算害怕，这也是大家的舞台！绝对要亲眼看一看才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d0925eef717a1793dc15930807226012d9cdd0f3a3b95ac3be97e77cfff495a3", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。ゲネプロ、\n社長と音無さんも来てくれましたよ。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。社长和音无小姐也来参加彩排了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e4cc18318c45ddbb3528e60903498a279384daea0e404d8635511fcd81e9ec74", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\n社長さんに音無先輩も、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n社长，还有音无前辈，辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "1cef7814580b3bfde4a9e0b757508490f9b1728c7f81a565796eab5915ed506f", "ja": "あら……美咲ちゃん、せっかくの\nゲネプロなのに、なんだか浮かない表情ね？", "zh": "哎呀……美咲，难得赶上了\n最终联排，怎么看起来闷闷不乐的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1004_president", "source_sha256": "eabf7a5620cc440452d1c97489bb7e7422858c0be15f5f8c0c18ac5475651897", "ja": "青羽君、何か悩んでいるのかね？\n相談してくれれば、我々が力を貸すよ！", "zh": "青羽，你是不是有什么烦恼？要是愿意找我们商量，我们会助你一臂之力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "5acf958fc961811039f4a6e3a0c2f90fb4fc07be82cd574cea4c5ea8adf36ee7", "ja": "い、いえ！　そんな大層な話では……！", "zh": "没、没有啦！并不是什么大不了的事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "7144b1dc9ea86b38b5d55e41502688d7c825b73a8b6ef3ba16c2bc8781380e71", "ja": "あら？　この座席表……\n私達のところだけ埋まっていないみたいね。", "zh": "哎呀？这张座位表……\n好像只有我们这里还没填上呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "61d3ad8a7ab148d0de22f25ac3ca30d40b26108f0fc491cbd7980339c9b59352", "ja": "なるほど、社長と音無さんの座席を\nどこにするかで悩んでたんですね！", "zh": "原来如此，你是在为社长和音无小姐的座位安排在哪里而烦恼啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "0981e88ae455d41b6d1e975b671f38643696fe857fe61a6e19fd52841fcf1150", "ja": "任せてくれたまえ！　では……この前列に\n私と音無君。後列に青羽君と君でどうだろう？", "zh": "交给我吧！那么……前排就由我和音无，后排由青羽和你，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f0d5c332dec6d82073bea6b19d8504f3a169d285c74a61a8b1f178613168fdd5", "ja": "はい、それで構いません。\n自分は、ずっと座席にはいられないと思いますし。", "zh": "嗯，这样就可以。\n我想自己也没法一直待在座位上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "a53666c89ff37bf3e52f3374391a721e121457e4de378e2929f4c91b9165f191", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます……。ホッ。\n{$P$}さんがいれば怖くないかも……", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……呼。\n有{$P$}先生在的话，或许就不用害怕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "dcecf7083be6bf60436cc35ca6e7230cf006de2eaac6c52f7e848e5b6956b054", "ja": "いえっ、なんでもないです！", "zh": "不，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "e57f3efc0e130dc5be2714874a25c4bf01bd7589c79c11211b065eb6f0b58404", "ja": "聞いたところによると……今回の芝居は、\nショッキングな場面もあるとかないとか……。", "zh": "听说……这次的戏剧，\n好像会有一些令人震撼的场面……也可能没有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "8cbc7e3ce7eaba80f350aec6d826b2cb8d442cf6240e29e6060c70b982e233d8", "ja": "より心を落ち着けて、平常心で臨まなくては。\n音無君も、そう思うだろう？", "zh": "更得让内心平静下来，以平常心去面对才行。\n音无君也是这么想的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "e32452e1e6cdf34ebe2fd544229ede885fa961730967e850c605df27fac7d167", "ja": "ふふっ。社長、あんまり怖いからって、\n悲鳴をあげたりしちゃダメですからね？", "zh": "呵呵。社长，您可不能因为太害怕，就尖叫起来哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "b44204885df230a8498bfc684097d71d4c77fb857d2559739205298f9b7636c0", "ja": "な、なにを言うんだね！　この高木順二朗、\n恐怖で悲鳴をあげるなど、断じてありえないよ！", "zh": "你、你在说什么啊！我高木顺二朗，\n怎么可能会因为恐惧而发出惨叫！绝对不可能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "892b3417c55c9b16ef47802d17b6b26306e4dd129ba3de42a2176c185c0a1bb1", "ja": "そこまで怖くはないと思いますが……\nさあ、時間です。どうぞ、楽しんでください！", "zh": "我觉得还没那么可怕……  \n好了，时间到了。请尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "b14dfd4e1b388dfa1a5fc039c7810c5bda97a1944e439fd56d8860ad7f0273fb", "ja": "お待たせいたしました。これより\nCLEVER CLOVERゲネプロ上演となります。", "zh": "让您久等了。接下来将进行\nCLEVER CLOVER的总彩排演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "e355a75780b31fb2209f42c9ce54846da45af702f4d053f7c5aff51118654be8", "ja": "765プロに咲く理性と英知のクローバー、\n心ゆくまでご鑑賞ください♪", "zh": "绽放于765艺能的理性与智慧的三叶草，\n请各位尽情欣赏吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
